{
  "name": "AI Inbox Agent → Google Tasks",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Inbox Agent → tasks\n\n1. Open **Inbox Agent webhook** and create a *Header Auth* credential: name `X-Inbox-Agent-Secret`, value = your `TASK_WEBHOOK_SECRET`.\n2. Connect your Google account in **Create Google Task** and pick a task list.\n3. Activate the workflow and copy the **Production URL** into the agent's `TASK_WEBHOOK_URL`.\n\nPrefer Notion or Todoist? Replace the last node with the Notion *Create database page* or Todoist *Create task* node; the fields are `title`, `notes` and the webhook's `body.priority`.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "5b0b8b1e-6d0a-4a4e-9a5e-0d2f6c1a0001",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "inbox-agent-tasks",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5b0b8b1e-6d0a-4a4e-9a5e-0d2f6c1a0002",
      "name": "Inbox Agent webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ],
      "webhookId": "2f1d6e1c-1d8e-4c55-9d0e-inboxagent01"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "body.tasks",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5b0b8b1e-6d0a-4a4e-9a5e-0d2f6c1a0003",
      "name": "One item per task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "task": "@default",
        "title": "={{ ($('Inbox Agent webhook').first().json.body.priority === 'high' ? '🔴 ' : '') + $json.title }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "notes": "={{ $json.notes }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "5b0b8b1e-6d0a-4a4e-9a5e-0d2f6c1a0004",
      "name": "Create Google Task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleTasks",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { ok: true, created: $input.all().length } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5b0b8b1e-6d0a-4a4e-9a5e-0d2f6c1a0005",
      "name": "Reply to agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        720,
        160
      ]
    }
  ],
